{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2022-11-28 09:30:00', 'title': 'COLGATE-PALMOLIVE WEBCASTS FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE MORGAN STANLEY GLOBAL CONSUMER & RETAIL CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--COLGATE-PALMOLIVE (NYSE:CL) GROUP PRESIDENT, EUROPE AND DEVELOPING MARKETS, PANAGIOTIS TSOURAPAS; CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, STAN SUTULA; AND CHIEF INVESTOR RELATIONS OFFICER AND SVP, M&A, JOHN FAUCHER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE MORGAN STANLEY GLOBAL CONSUMER & RETAIL CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, DECEMBER 6, 2022 AT 1:45 P.M. ET.'}